<import src="../../templates/common.wxml" />
<view class="page">
  <button class="plain" bindtap="back">返回</button><text class="eyebrow">TEAM HONOR SUBMISSION</text><text class="title">{{record ? '荣誉投稿与回执' : '新建荣誉投稿'}}</text>
  <text class="subtitle">提交获准公开的成果证据。保存修改会撤下当前展示；提交后由他人审核，批准后才进入队伍荣誉档案。</text>
  <template is="feedback" data="{{needsLogin}}" /><text wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">正在核对投稿资料与操作权限…</text><text wx:if="{{busy}}" class="muted">本次确认、选图或保存尚未结束，请稍候。</text>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="section"><text class="error">{{error}}</text><button class="secondary" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">重新读取回执</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{!needsLogin}}">
    <view wx:if="{{record}}" class="panel section"><text class="section-title">{{record.statusText}}</text><text class="muted">投稿 {{record.id}} · 修订 {{record.revision}} · {{teamTitle}}</text><text wx:if="{{record.reviewNote}}" class="body">处理反馈：{{record.reviewNote}}</text><text wx:if="{{record.season}}" class="muted">原赛季 {{record.season}}；历史队伍与赛季归属保留。</text></view>
    <view class="panel section editor">
      <view wx:if="{{!record}}" class="field"><text class="field-label">所属有效代表队</text><picker range="{{teams}}" range-key="title" value="{{teamIndex}}" bindchange="team" disabled="{{busy || loading || !ready || uncertainCreate}}"><view>{{teamTitle || '暂无可投稿的有效队伍'}}</view></picker></view>
      <text wx:if="{{!editable && !loading}}" class="muted">当前资料只读。可重新读取回执，查看服务端当前允许的操作。</text>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">荣誉标题</text><input value="{{fields.title}}" maxlength="120" bindinput="input" data-field="title" disabled="{{busy || loading || !editable}}" /></view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">赛事名称</text><input value="{{fields.competition}}" maxlength="200" bindinput="input" data-field="competition" disabled="{{busy || loading || !editable}}" /></view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">奖项或名次</text><input value="{{fields.placing}}" maxlength="200" bindinput="input" data-field="placing" disabled="{{busy || loading || !editable}}" /></view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">赛事日期</text><view class="row"><picker mode="date" value="{{fields.date}}" bindchange="date" disabled="{{busy || loading || !editable}}"><view>{{fields.date || '请选择赛事日期'}}</view></picker><button class="plain" bindtap="clearDate" disabled="{{busy || loading || !editable}}">清空</button></view></view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">获奖说明</text><textarea value="{{fields.description}}" maxlength="5000" bindinput="input" data-field="description" disabled="{{busy || loading || !editable}}" /></view>
      <text class="section-title">审核证据</text><text class="muted">提交时至少一份图片或已保存视频。图片每份 2 MB、最多 6 份；请逐份填写说明。</text>
      <view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="index" class="evidence"><image wx:if="{{item.path}}" class="photo" mode="widthFix" src="{{item.path}}" bindtap="previewEvidence" data-path="{{item.path}}" aria-label="{{item.caption || '荣誉证据图片'}}" /><view class="field"><text class="field-label">证据 {{index+1}} 说明</text><input value="{{item.caption}}" maxlength="200" bindinput="caption" data-index="{{index}}" disabled="{{busy || loading || !editable}}" /></view><button class="plain" bindtap="removeImage" data-index="{{index}}" disabled="{{busy || loading || !editable}}">移除此证据图片</button></view>
      <text wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="muted">{{imageError}}</text><button class="secondary section" bindtap="chooseImages" disabled="{{busy || loading || !editable || images.length >= 6}}">添加证据图片</button><button class="plain" bindtap="openPrivacy" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">查看微信隐私指引</button>
      <view wx:if="{{record.hasVideo}}" class="field"><text class="muted">已有视频证据会保留。</text><label class="row"><text>移除已保存视频</text><switch checked="{{fields.removeVideo}}" bindchange="removeVideo" disabled="{{busy || loading || !editable}}" /></label></view>
      <text class="muted section">MP4 每份最多 10 MB。请先明确保存图片草稿，再单独选择并上传视频；上传会保存为草稿，仍须提交审核。</text><button wx:if="{{record}}" class="secondary section" bindtap="chooseVideo" disabled="{{busy || loading || !editable || !canSave}}">选择 MP4 视频</button><text wx:if="{{!record}}" class="muted">保存草稿取得回执后，可选择视频。</text><text wx:if="{{hasSelectedVideo}}" class="muted">已主动选择视频 · {{selectedVideoSize}}</text><button wx:if="{{hasSelectedVideo}}" class="primary section" bindtap="uploadVideo" disabled="{{busy || loading || !canUploadVideo}}">上传视频并保存草稿</button>
      <button wx:if="{{record.hasVideo}}" class="plain" bindtap="viewVideo" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">读取已保存视频证据</button><video wx:if="{{videoSource}}" id="honor-own-video" class="evidence-video" src="{{videoSource}}" controls autoplay="{{false}}" binderror="videoError" data-id="{{record.id}}" data-revision="{{record.revision}}" aria-label="已保存荣誉视频证据" /><text wx:if="{{videoError}}" class="error">{{videoError}}</text>
      <view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || loading || !canSave}}">保存草稿</button><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || loading || !canSubmit}}">提交审核</button></view>
    </view>
    <text wx:if="{{operationError}}" class="error" aria-role="alert">{{operationError}}</text><text wx:if="{{message}}" class="body" aria-role="status">{{message}}</text>
    <text wx:if="{{uncertainCreate}}" class="muted">新建结果尚未确认，请先查看本人记录。同名记录需要你逐份核对，本页不会自动认领。</text>
    <view wx:for="{{recentDocs}}" wx:key="id" class="panel section"><text class="section-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="badge">{{item.statusText}}</text><text class="muted">投稿 {{item.id}} · 队伍 {{item.team}}</text><button class="plain" bindtap="openRecent" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查看此本人回执</button></view>
    <view class="actions"><button class="plain" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">重新读取当前状态</button><button wx:if="{{record}}" class="plain" bindtap="reload" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">重新加载已保存资料</button><button class="plain" bindtap="mine" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">荣誉工作台 / 我的记录 →</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
<privacy-consent id="privacyConsent" />
